WEBVTT

00:54:57.278 --> 00:55:01.437
"I've got you. I'm right here.
I see how distressed you are.

00:55:01.461 --> 00:55:02.705
It's all right.

00:55:02.729 --> 00:55:05.050
I don't need you to feel better."

00:55:05.074 --> 00:55:08.470
I think a lot of our anxiety
is that we want to get out of that feeling

00:55:08.494 --> 00:55:09.645
as fast as we can,

00:55:09.669 --> 00:55:11.909
and what Love always says to me is,

00:55:11.933 --> 00:55:15.575
"It makes no difference to me
whether you're anxious or afraid

00:55:15.599 --> 00:55:16.966
or angry or hurt.

00:55:16.990 --> 00:55:18.141
I'm with you,

00:55:18.165 --> 00:55:20.883
and I'll be with you
through this entire thing

00:55:20.907 --> 00:55:23.129
for however long it takes.

00:55:23.153 --> 00:55:24.304
I'm not going anywhere.

00:55:24.328 --> 00:55:27.868
I've got nowhere better to be right now
than sitting with you, loving you.

00:55:27.892 --> 00:55:30.018
I'll be with you
at the moment of your death.